  _skillName: Volley
  _description: Attack Pattern Directive Group 2 - Multi-Hit Volley, first pattern
    ("Basic Count"). 8 hits cycling the compass positions around the target in order
    N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W, NW. Hits 1-4 use a circle marker (left-click); hits 5-8
    use a square marker (right-click). Every hit resolves and deals damage independently
    - a miss does not cancel later hits.
